<title>UK: UK Sept global trade deficit 899 mln stg.</title>
<headline>UK Sept global trade deficit 899 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Office for National Statistics issued the following data on Britain's global trade in September(in million stg, previously announced data in brackets)</p>
<p>    GLOBAL TRADE	     SEPT     AUG     (PREL AUG)</p>
<p>    Trade balance	   -899     -568	  (-584)</p>
<p>    Exports		    14,220   13,887   (13,933)</p>
<p>    Imports		    15,119   14,455   (14,517)</p>
<p>    EU trade balance	 -94	-33	    (13)</p>
<p>    EU exports		 8,315    7,876     (7,919)</p>
<p>    EU imports		 8,409    7,909     (7,906)</p>
<p>    TRADE VALUE EX OIL/ERRATICS    SEPT     AUG    (PREL AUG)</p>
<p>    Trade balance (in million stg)    -1,389   -1,137  (-1,183)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (imports)  2.5%    unch     (0.5%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (exports)  2.5%    1.5%     (1.0%)</p>
<p>TRADE VOLUME EX OIL/ERRATICS</p>
<p>    Import volume index (base 1990) 130.7   126.8    (126.9)</p>
<p>    Export volume index (base 1990) 145.7   142.6    (141.9)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (imports) 4.0%    1.5%	(2.0%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on yr-ago qtr (imps) 9.0%    7.5%	(8.0%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (exports) 3.0%    2.5%	(2.0%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on yr-ago qtr (exps) 7.5%    7.0%	(7.0%)</p>
<p>    TRADE IN OIL (VALUE MLN STG)    SEPT     AUG   (PREL AUG)</p>
<p>    BALANCE				  379     393	(425)</p>
<p>    EXPORTS				  825     826	(859)</p>
<p>    IMPORTS				  446     433	(434)</p>
<p>Economists had forecast a deficit of 1.0 billion stg.</p>
